  "term": "brain concussion",
  "definition": "Brain concussion is a general term for a temporary change in awareness or a brief loss of consciousness after a closed head injury. The unconsciousness usually lasts seconds but can continue for several hours, and concussions may be described as mild, intermediate, or severe.",
